================================================================================
2. SOURCE STUBS (All Rights Reserved)
================================================================================

The following files are reference function signatures only. They are
NOT open source. They are NOT in the public domain. They are NOT
available for reuse, modification, redistribution, or use as the basis
of a derivative work, in any form, without explicit written permission
from the author:

  src/offside-decision/decision_stub.py
  src/field-calibration/calib_stub.py
  src/decision-packet/packet_stub.py
  src/collar/feedback_stub.py

The intent of this restriction is documented in `src/README.md`. The
short version: the stubs are documentation artifacts, not source code
meant to be built on. The function signatures are published so that
readers can confirm they match the architecture and the protocol. The
bodies are `raise NotImplementedError` by design.

